<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="cards" data-stagger><a class="card tool-card rv" href="/claim-gap-tools/claim-gap-net-recovery-estimator/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-tag">Estimator</span></span><span class="card-b"><h2>Claim Gap &amp; Net Recovery Estimator</h2><span class="card-p">Size the dispute, project an award and subtract appraiser and umpire fees, with three scenarios side by side.</span><span class="card-more">Open tool <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="card tool-card rv" href="/claim-gap-tools/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/laptop-spreadsheet.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/laptop-spreadsheet-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/laptop-spreadsheet.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1024" height="626" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-tag">Calculator</span></span><span class="card-b"><h2>RCV/ACV Holdback Calculator</h2><span class="card-p">Line-item depreciation that shows your first ACV check, the holdback and the total once repairs are done.</span><span class="card-more">Open tool <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="card tool-card rv" href="/claim-gap-tools/roof-pitch-squares-calculator/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/shingle-roof.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/shingle-roof-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/shingle-roof.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-tag">Calculator</span></span><span class="card-b"><h2>Roof Pitch &amp; Squares Calculator</h2><span class="card-p">Turn a footprint into true roof squares by pitch and waste, then compare with the carrier’s figure.</span><span class="card-more">Open tool <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="card tool-card rv" href="/claim-gap-tools/percentage-deductible-calculator/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hailstones.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hailstones-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hailstones.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1024" height="660" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-tag">Calculator</span></span><span class="card-b"><h2>Percentage Deductible Calculator</h2><span class="card-p">See a percentage wind/hail deductible in dollars and how much a storm claim would actually pay.</span><span class="card-more">Open tool <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="card tool-card rv" href="/claim-gap-tools/claim-timeline-builder/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/documents-review.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/documents-review-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/documents-review.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-tag">Planner</span></span><span class="card-b"><h2>Claim Timeline Builder</h2><span class="card-p">Build a dated timeline of notice, proof of loss, holdback and suit dates and download it as a calendar file.</span><span class="card-more">Open tool <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="card tool-card rv" href="/claim-gap-tools/appraisal-readiness-checkup/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consultation.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-tag">Checklist</span></span><span class="card-b"><h2>Appraisal Readiness Checkup</h2><span class="card-p">Twelve yes/no questions that score your claim file and build a to-do list before you demand appraisal.</span><span class="card-more">Open tool <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="card tool-card rv" href="/claim-gap-tools/roof-snow-load-estimator/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/snow-roof.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/snow-roof-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/snow-roof.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-tag">Estimator</span></span><span class="card-b"><h2>Roof Snow Load Estimator</h2><span class="card-p">Estimate the weight of snow and ice on your roof, a real concern in Indiana’s lake-effect counties.</span><span class="card-more">Open tool <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap split top"><div class="rv"><p class="kicker">Suggested order</p><h2>Using the tools together</h2><ol><li>Start with the <a href="/claim-gap-tools/claim-timeline-builder/">claim timeline builder</a> so nothing lapses.</li><li>Check roof math with the <a href="/claim-gap-tools/roof-pitch-squares-calculator/">roof pitch &amp; squares calculator</a>.</li><li>See what you’ll actually receive with the <a href="/claim-gap-tools/percentage-deductible-calculator/">percentage deductible</a> and <a href="/claim-gap-tools/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/">holdback</a> calculators.</li><li>Size the dispute with the <a href="/claim-gap-tools/claim-gap-net-recovery-estimator/">claim gap estimator</a>.</li><li>Finish with the <a href="/claim-gap-tools/appraisal-readiness-checkup/">readiness checkup</a>.</li></ol><p>Winter claim? The <a href="/claim-gap-tools/roof-snow-load-estimator/">roof snow load estimator</a> shows what lake-effect snow and ice weigh.</p></div><div class="rv"><div class="side-box call-box"><p class="side-h">Talk it through</p><p>A free first conversation. We’ll tell you honestly whether appraisal fits your claim.</p><a class="call-num" href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-gold btn-block" href="/contact-us/">Send claim details</a></div></div></div></section>
